Package: MSACalcQALY
Type: Package
Title: Calculate EQ-5D Health-Utility Values in Multiple System Atrophy
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Igor", "Kuchin",
      email = "igor.kuchin@umit-tirol.at",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Calculates utility values for individuals with Multiple System Atrophy (MSA) based on age, sex, disease stage, and country-specific EQ-5D value sets.
    The package includes functions for deterministic (median with 95% CrI) and stochastic (random draws) utility estimation.
